"use strict";(self.webpackChunkwoocommerce_package_slips_doc=self.webpackChunkwoocommerce_package_slips_doc||[]).push([[281],{665(e,o,r){r.r(o),r.d(o,{_pageData:()=>n,default:()=>s});var t=r(641);const n=JSON.parse('{"path":"/woocommerce-package-slips/workflow.html","title":"Administrative Order Workflow","lang":"en-US","frontmatter":{"title":"Administrative Order Workflow","description":"Learn how to manage, download, regenerate, and bulk-process PDF documents within the WooCommerce admin panels."},"git":{},"filePathRelative":"woocommerce-package-slips/workflow.md"}'),a={name:"workflow.md"},s=(0,r(6262).A)(a,[["render",function(e,o,r,n,a,s){return(0,t.uX)(),(0,t.CE)("div",null,[...o[0]||(o[0]=[(0,t.Fv)('<h1 id="order-management-fulfillment" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#order-management-fulfillment"><span>Order Management &amp; Fulfillment</span></a></h1><p>The plugin integrates document controls directly into the WooCommerce order fulfillment process. Store owners and warehouse teams can manage documents individually from the order detail screen or process them in bulk from the main document portal.</p><hr><h2 id="single-order-management-screen" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#single-order-management-screen"><span>Single Order Management Screen</span></a></h2><p>When viewing or editing a single order (<strong>WooCommerce</strong> → <strong>Orders</strong> → Click on an order), a new <strong>PDF Documents</strong> meta box appears in the right-hand sidebar.</p><p><img src="/woocommerce-pdf-invoices-packing-slips/images/woocommerce-package-slips/view-order.png" alt="Single Order PDF Sidebar"></p><h3 id="available-sidebar-actions" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#available-sidebar-actions"><span>Available Sidebar Actions:</span></a></h3><ul><li><strong>View Document:</strong> Click on the document title (e.g., <strong>Invoice</strong> or <strong>Packing Slip</strong>) to open the PDF in your browser or download it (depending on your chosen <em>Viewing Mode</em>).</li><li><strong>Create Document:</strong> If a document type has not been generated for the order yet, click the <strong>Generate</strong> button to create it.</li><li><strong>Regenerate Document:</strong> Click the <strong>Regenerate</strong> (refresh icon) button if you modify the order items, customer addresses, or tax calculations. This updates the PDF document contents with the new billing totals.</li><li><strong>Delete Document:</strong> Click the <strong>Delete</strong> (trash icon) button to remove the document record from the database. Note that deleting a document allows you to reset the numbering sequence if needed.</li></ul><hr><h2 id="woocommerce-order-list-columns" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#woocommerce-order-list-columns"><span>WooCommerce Order List Columns</span></a></h2><p>To save time during packing and fulfillment, shortcuts are embedded directly into the main WooCommerce Orders list table (<strong>WooCommerce</strong> → <strong>Orders</strong>).</p><p><img src="/woocommerce-pdf-invoices-packing-slips/images/woocommerce-package-slips/order-list.png" alt="WooCommerce Orders List Column"></p><ul><li><strong>PDF Documents Column:</strong> Renders action buttons for each enabled document.</li><li><strong>Fulfillment Action:</strong> Click the corresponding icon (e.g., <em>Page</em> icon for Invoice, <em>Box</em> icon for Packing Slip) to preview or download the file immediately without loading the entire order detail page.</li></ul><hr><h2 id="central-pdf-invoices-dashboard-portal" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#central-pdf-invoices-dashboard-portal"><span>Central PDF Invoices Dashboard Portal</span></a></h2><p>Navigate to <strong>WooCommerce</strong> → <strong>PDF Invoices</strong> to view a central repository of all documents generated by your store.</p><p><img src="/woocommerce-pdf-invoices-packing-slips/images/woocommerce-package-slips/admin-dashboard.png" alt="PDF Invoices central portal"></p><h3 id="key-portal-features" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#key-portal-features"><span>Key Portal Features:</span></a></h3><h3 id="_1-document-filter-tabs" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-document-filter-tabs"><span>1. Document Filter Tabs</span></a></h3><p>Easily toggle between tabs to view list records of:</p><ul><li>Invoices</li><li>Credit Notes</li><li>Packing Slips</li><li>Proforma Invoices</li><li>Picking Lists</li></ul><h3 id="_2-search-date-range-filters" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-search-date-range-filters"><span>2. Search &amp; Date Range Filters</span></a></h3><ul><li><strong>Search Field:</strong> Type an invoice number (e.g., <code>INV-2026-00045</code>) or order ID to find the matching transaction record.</li><li><strong>Date Filters:</strong> Enter a <strong>From</strong> date and <strong>To</strong> date and click <strong>Filter</strong> to restrict the listing to a specific tax month, quarter, or year.</li></ul><h3 id="_3-bulk-operations" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-bulk-operations"><span>3. Bulk Operations</span></a></h3><ul><li><strong>ZIP Archive Download:</strong> Select multiple documents (or filter by date range) and click the <strong>Download all</strong> button. This compiles all selected invoices into a single structured ZIP file for your accounting archives.</li><li><strong>Merged PDF Download:</strong> Click the <strong>Download all as one PDF</strong> button to merge multiple documents into a single, continuous PDF file. This is highly useful for sending a single print command to a warehouse printer for all orders processed during a shift.</li><li><strong>Bulk Delete:</strong> Tick checkboxes next to documents, select <strong>Delete</strong> from the bulk dropdown, and click <strong>Apply</strong> to purge multiple records simultaneously.</li></ul>',25)])])}]])}}]);